## 6. Cluster E — Integration Standards and Tools

17. **ARM** — *AMBA AXI and ACE Protocol Specification* (IHI 0022). TVALID/TREADY/TLAST semantics for your waveform deliverable.
18. **Xilinx** — *AXI Reference Guide* (UG1037).
19. **Xilinx** — *AXI DMA LogiCORE IP Product Guide* (PG021). Register map and driver model for the Vitis application.
20. **Xilinx** — *Zynq-7000 SoC Technical Reference Manual* (UG585). AXI-HP ports and PS–PL paths.
21. **Xilinx** — *Vivado Design Suite User Guide: Synthesis* (UG901). **Read the ROM inference section before deciding whether the K constants live in LUTs or BRAM** — it is a genuine area experiment with a measurable outcome.
22. **Avnet** — *ZedBoard Hardware User's Guide*.

